Virtual Double Oracle research software
Ruilan Wang, Francisco Aristi Reina and Katerina Papadaki

This distribution contains source derived from OpenSpiel and Francisco Aristi
Reina's VDO-PSRO implementation. Existing DeepMind copyright and Apache-2.0
notices are retained in the source files to which they apply. The Apache-2.0
license text is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

Modified distributions of those files retain their numerical algorithms;
presentation and documentation have been adapted, and the VDOMetaSolver
default selects the per-player protocol used by the paper.

